0402BD             0495*   @riff_end_ready:
0402BD 22 C8 00 04 0496*       ld (agnb_state+agnb_state_riff_end),hl
0402C1 32 CB 00 04 0497*       ld (agnb_state+agnb_state_riff_end+3),a
